        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Writing books for children may look easy, but it is not. Good writers and artists spend many years making simple but "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "meaningful",
            "ref": "v-meaningful"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " stories."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Two winners of the 2026 Hans Christian Andersen "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Award",
            "zh": "国际安徒生大奖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are Michael Rosen and Cai Gao. They both write and draw books for young readers. Their work shows that children’s books can have deep ideas and strong feelings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Michael Rosen writes funny and sad stories. In one book, a boy "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "quietly",
            "ref": "v-quietly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " goes "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "downstairs",
            "ref": "v-downstairs"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at night to eat chocolate cake. It shows everyday life through a child’s eyes. In another book, Rosen talks about the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "loss",
            "zh": "丧失"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of his son. He shows that it is okay to feel sad and talk about feelings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cai Gao is an artist who draws beautiful pictures for children’s books. One of her books is about a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fisherman",
            "ref": "v-fisherman"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " who finds a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hidden",
            "zh": "隐秘的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " village. Her drawings are warm and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "peaceful",
            "ref": "v-peaceful"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She wants children to see "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "beauty",
            "ref": "v-beauty"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the world around them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These works show that children’s books are small in size but strong in meaning."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
